WEBVTT

00:01:29.076 --> 00:01:33.556
Documentary filmmaking, you see,
became my way of resistance.

00:01:34.756 --> 00:01:39.396
I documented stories of Syrians
who opposed the Assad regime,

00:01:39.396 --> 00:01:43.716
in 2011, when the revolution started.

00:01:43.756 --> 00:01:47.116
I was arrested, tortured

00:01:47.116 --> 00:01:49.316
and sexually assaulted.

00:01:49.316 --> 00:01:52.796
When I was released, I left Syria.

00:01:52.836 --> 00:01:54.396
I was traumatized

00:01:55.116 --> 00:01:57.436
and tried to end my life.

00:01:57.436 --> 00:02:02.196
My wife stood by me
and helped me hang onto life.